{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-23T08:47:01.041Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"6fe7ba654eae068ba842efbc","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-3s4jwl","claim:pm-8patuh","claim:pm-g2zzus","claim:pm-gh1769","claim:pm-lulgxc","lineage:pm-3s4jwl","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-3s4jwl+pm-8patuh+pm-g2zzus+pm-gh1769+pm-lulgxc","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-3s4jwl","claim:pm-8patuh","claim:pm-g2zzus","claim:pm-gh1769","claim:pm-lulgxc","lineage:pm-3s4jwl","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.330","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-23T08:47:01.041Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-23T08:47:01.040Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation evidence (2026-11-23). runRegisteredCommandForTest (src/sdk/testing.ts) now calls the shared validateReadOutputOptions before the handler runs, inside an isolated extension runtime that holds the activation's registrations, so resolveReadOutputSurface sees the command's read_output declaration exactly as CLI preAction and PmClient.run dispatchAction do. Controls are read from both places a harness caller can put them: global (outputInclude, outputLimit, outputBudget, outputFormat, outputSession, outputCursor, outputRowContract) and options (camel or snake keys). A hand-built registry carries no declarations and is not checked, matching admitRegisteredReadOutputResult.\n\nThe native refusal was untyped (command_failed). It now carries the stable code read_output_surface_unsupported (exit 2, same message) with details.output_option_keys, required and why; READ_OUTPUT_SURFACE_UNSUPPORTED_CODE is exported. Probed on the built CLI: pm create Task --title x --output-row-contract refuses with the new code, so output-row-contract reaches the native check through command options and including it in the harness keeps parity.\n\nParity spec (direct-caller-option-contract.integration.spec.ts): for --output-budget, --output-limit, --output-include and --output-cursor the built CLI refuses probe option with read_output_surface_unsupported, and the harness refuses the same invocation through global and through options with the same code, exit 2 and message; the handler's run counter shows no run happened; --output-format yaml is refused with the native message in both; probe report (declares read_output) accepts --output-limit in both. harness-parity.spec.ts adds the extended native hybrid surface (comments with add plus outputLimit refuses read_output_mutation_conflict) and the hand-built registry skip.\n"}]}],"before_hash":"b78f8b57a7475ec5b2f9517eb6e9770f7871c49dc5138d55e7772cb9e8b9708f","after_hash":"83363ddcfc321153b34978a7dee03e6efbf4798ef69f79dba0622e5b4e5261eb","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"56a8bfed011590bc62c3a035e8c68fd042e65397dbf88db76dfcea8a5e50b044"}
