{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-23T10:16:00.117Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"6fe7ba654eae068ba842efbc","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-5mstyv","lineage:pm-5mstyv","lineage:pm-92if","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-5mstyv","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-5mstyv","lineage:pm-5mstyv","lineage:pm-92if","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.330","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-23T10:16:00.116Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Review round 1 on PR #1772 (Codex gpt-6.2-sol, 2026-11-23), two harness findings fixed. (1) Positional annotation text: native dispatch maps the second positional of comments, notes and learnings to add before validating output controls, so pm comments <id> \"text\" --output-limit 1 refuses read_output_mutation_conflict; the harness checked only options. annotationPositionalMutationOptions moved from src/cli/register-annotations.ts to src/sdk/read-output-contracts.ts (exported) and both the CLI preAction and the harness call it. (2) Order: native dispatch admits host output controls in preAction, before the action wrapper normalizes extension flags, so a non-read command given outputLimit and missing a required flag refuses read_output_surface_unsupported natively; the harness threw missing_required_option first. The harness admission now runs on the raw options before normalization. harness-parity.spec.ts covers both.\n"}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-23T10:16:00.117Z"}],"before_hash":"2ae32b25a422aaa7dea27157